            owl:onProperty fof_ct:spot_id ],
        linkml:ClassDefinition ;
    skos:definition "A single row in the Spot Biological Data table. Each instance captures one or more user-defined biological properties for a specific DNA bright Spot identified by Spot_ID. Spot_ID values must be unique across the dataset, linking to the corresponding Spot record in the core table (table 1). At least one user-defined biological property column MUST be present; users declare these via #^ header lines." ;
    skos:inScheme fof_ct:bio .

